Package: el-eld
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: enterprise-linux <https://github.com/RohiRIK/enterprise-linux>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/RohiRIK/enterprise-linux
Description: enterprise-linux control daemon (eld) and CLI (elctl)
 Local control API for facts, policy, actions, roles and audit over a Unix
 socket. v0 prototype: most settings are recorded but not enforced yet.
